<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="EPH" style="id">EFE Kuturikihwa kwoBhaibheri muchiKorekore</book>
  <para style="h">VAEFESO</para>
  <para style="toc1">Tsamba raPhauro kuvaEfeso</para>
  <para style="toc2">VaEfeso</para>
  <para style="toc3">VaEf</para>
  <para style="mt2">Tsamba ridonyohwa naPhauro</para>
  <para style="mt1">KuvaEfeso</para>
  <para style="imt">Kuwidzira</para>
  <para style="ip">Tsamba kuvaEfeso idonyohwa panguwa inenge idofanana noidonyohwa kuvaKorose mumakore 60 musure mokuzvahwa kwaKhirisitu. Munyori anozvizivisa kuti ndiNhumwa Phauro (VaEfeso1:1).</para>
  <para style="ip">Nyanzvi dzoBhaibhiri dzizinji dzinobvumirana kuti ndiPhauro adonyora vaEfeso kunyange zvazvene pasinai zvidofanana nokumoresana kwaanoita pachake fanike zviri muna vaKorose. Nochikonzero chakarechi tsamba iyoyi yaigona kutenderedzewa ichiverengewa kumakherekhe yese mudunhu rakarero. Phauro adonyaira pakare kuti waiva mutorongo paadonyora tsamba irori (vaEfeso 3:1, 4:1 Na6:20).</para>
  <para style="ip">Phauro adotumira tsamba iyoyi naTaichikasi paaiva pahwendo hwokubvakachira kherekhe yokuEfeso (vaEfeso 6:21-22).</para>
  <para style="ip">Efeso raiva guta ridokuritsa futi ndiro raiva rikuru mudunhu roRoma raiitiwa Ezhiya Maina. Efeso raiva guta ridokurumbira nondava yokuva noimba yochimwarikadzi chomabhwodo chochiGiriki chaiitiwa Atemisi (Mabasa 19:23-31).</para>
  <para style="ip">Kherekhe yopaEfeso idothanga nosimba asi mumasure monguwa idorosa (Zvidozaruhwa 2:1-7).</para>
  <para style="ip">Muzvitsauko zvitatu zvokuthanga zvotsamba Phauro anotsanangura kuti Mwari adosarura tini vanhu vache nokuvaponesa kubva kuzvitadzo zvavo kuburikidza naJesu Khirisitu. Anofananidza kherekhe kuti idoita kunge muviri naJesu ari musoro, yofanana futi nochivakwa icho Khirisitu ari nheyo yachene. Muzvitsauko zvitatu zvokupedzisira mutsamba Phauro anoraira pamusoro pomagariro yochiKhirisitu.</para>
  <para style="iot">Marongehwo</para>
  <para style="io1">Muchitsauko (vaEfeso 1:1-2) Phauro anotaura kuti iye mbani futi anomoresa vanhu vomuEfeso</para>
  <para style="io1">Zvino anodzotsanangura kuti ukama hwokherekhe naKhirisitu hudomira tini (vaEfeso 1:3—3:21)</para>
  <para style="io1">Phauro anonyora pamusoro pomagariro yomaKhirisitu (vaEfeso 4:1—6:20)</para>
  <para style="io1">Pakupedzisira Phauro anopasa kurudziro yaanodzovhara nayo tsamba (vaEfeso 6:21-24)</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="EPH 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 1:1" />Phauro, Nhumwa yaKhirisitu Jesu kuburikidza nokuda kwaMwari,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EPH 1:1">kuvatsvene novadotendeka muna Khirisitu Jesu:<verse eid="EPH 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 1:2" />Mutsa norunyararo zvinobva kuna Mwari Baba vedu nokuna Ishe Jesu Khirisitu mbazvive kwamuri.<verse eid="EPH 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Munamato waPhauro kuvaVerengi Vache</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 1:3" />Mbaaropafadziwe Mwari naBaba vaIshe wedu Jesu Khirisitu, adotiropafadza muna Khirisitu nokuropafadziwa kwese mumweya kunzvimbo dzokudzuru. <verse eid="EPH 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 1:4" />Sezvaadotisarura kuti tive maari nyika isinati yavapo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EPH 1:4">Kuti tive vatsvene murudo tisinai chatinopomehwa pamberi pache. <verse eid="EPH 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 1:5" />Adoita kuti tive vana vache kare kuburikidza naJesu Khirisitu, zvichienderana nomaonero yache yadonaka, <verse eid="EPH 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 1:6" />kuti zvipase kurumbidziwa kwokubhwinya kwomutsa wache, waadotipasa pasinai muripo muna iyeyo Anodiwa. <verse eid="EPH 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 1:7" />Maari tinokudzikinuhwa kuburikidza nogazi rache, nokurekerehwa kwokuphonya kwedu zvichienderana nokupfuma kwomutsa wache, <verse eid="EPH 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 1:8" />waadoita kuti tiphunge nawo,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EPH 1:8">Nokuziva kwese nokunzvitsitsa, <verse eid="EPH 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 1:9" />adotizivisa chidohwanda chokuda kwache zvichienderana nokuda kwache kudonaka, kwaadofunga muna Khirisitu. <verse eid="EPH 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 1:10" />Kuti chinangwacho chiitike kana nguwa yazazisiwa, kuti abatanidze zvinhu zvese muna Khirisitu, zvinhu zviri kudenga nozviri panyika.<verse eid="EPH 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 1:11" />Maari, tidosaruhwa kare zvichienderana nochinangwa chourongwa hwache iye anoshanda zvinhu zvese kuti zvienderane nokuda kwache, <verse eid="EPH 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 1:12" />kuti isisu tidothanga kuva notariro muna Khirisitu, tive vadomirira kurumbidziwa kwokubhwinya kwache.<verse eid="EPH 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 1:13" />Maari naimimiwo, vadonzva shoko rochokwadi, Nhau Dzidonaka dzokuponesewa kwenyu, mudobva matenda kwaari, ndokubva maisiwa chisimbiso chochivimbiso choMweya Mutsvene. <verse eid="EPH 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 1:14" />anova chibatiso chonhaka yedu kusvikira pakudzikinuhwa kwoavo vanova vache Mwari, kuitira kuti kubhwinya kwache kurumbidziwe.<verse eid="EPH 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Munamato WaPhauro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 1:15" />Nondava yakarei, nokuti ndidonzva zvokutenda kwenyu muna Ishe Jesu norudo renyu kuvatsvene vese, <verse eid="EPH 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 1:16" />ndinorekaba kutenda nondava yenyu, pandinokuyeukai muminamato yangu <verse eid="EPH 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 1:17" />kuti Mwari waIshe wedu Jesu Khirisitu, Baba wokubhwinya, akupasei mweya wouchenjeri nowokuzurukihwa mukumuziva iye. <verse eid="EPH 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 1:18" />Muve nomeso yomwoyo yadopengenuka, kuti muzive zvidoita tariro yamudodaidzihwa, nozvidoita upfumi kwonhaka inobhwinya yokugara kwache muvatsvene, <verse eid="EPH 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 1:19" />futi kuti mukuriro hwai wosimba rache risingayereki riri muna isisu tinotenda, zvichienderana nokushanda kwache kudokura zvidokungudza <verse eid="EPH 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 1:20" />kwaadozazisa muna Khirisitu paadomumutsa kuvadopfa nokumugarisa kujanja rache roruji kunzvimbo dzokudenga, <verse eid="EPH 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 1:21" />kumusoro kurefurefu kwoutongi hwese novabati novanosimba nochikuriri, nopamusoro pomazita yese yanodaidziwa, zvisiri zvopanguwa ino chete asi panoichauyawo, <verse eid="EPH 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 1:22" />futi Mwari adoisa zvinhu zvese pasi potsoka dzache ndokumuita musoro pazvinhu zvese kukherekhe, <verse eid="EPH 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 1:23" />ndiwo muviri wache, mukuzara kwache iye anozadza zvese, kwese.<verse eid="EPH 1:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="EPH 2" />
  <para style="s">Kubva Muipfa Kupinda Muupenyu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 2:1" />Zvino imipa, pamanga mudopfa muzvinyangadzo nozvitadzo zvenyu. <verse eid="EPH 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 2:2" />Muchitekaira makaremo, muchitevera gwara ronyika ino, muchitevera mutongi wosimba romumhepo, mweya uri kushanda izvozvi muvanakomana vasingateerere. <verse eid="EPH 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 2:3" />Tese tidomborarama tiri pakati pavo mukuchiva kwonyama yedu, tichitevera zvido zvomiviri nopfungwa, pamamiriro taitova vana vokumwamwihwa, fanike vazinji voyamwe marudzi.<verse eid="EPH 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 2:4" />Asi Mwari adopfuma patsitsi, zvichibva parudo rikuru raadotida naro, <verse eid="EPH 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 2:5" />kana zvazvene tanga tidopfa kuburikidza nozvitadzo zvedu, adotiraramisa pabodzi naKhirisitu tidoponesewa nomutsa. <verse eid="EPH 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 2:6" />Mwari adotimutsa pabodzi naye, ndokutigarisa pabodzi naye kunzvimbo dzokudenga muna Khirisitu Jesu, <verse eid="EPH 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 2:7" />kuti panguwa inouya adzonangidza kupfuma kusingayereke kwomutsa wache kwatiri muna Khirisitu Jesu. <verse eid="EPH 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 2:8" />Nokuti mudoponesewa nomutsa kuburikidza nokutenda, zvisingabve kwamuri, asi nzvochipo chaMwari peno, <verse eid="EPH 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 2:9" />nzvomabasaba, kuti kureke kuva nomunhu anozvikudza. <verse eid="EPH 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 2:10" />Nokuti tiri basa romanja yache, tidosikiwa muna Khirisitu Jesu kuti tiite mabasa yadonaka, yadonhadzihwa kare naMwari, kuti tiyaite.<verse eid="EPH 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ubodzi Muna Khirisitu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 2:11" />Saka yeukai kuti kare imipa vokuzvahwa musiri maJudha, muchidaidziwa kuti vasinai kuchecheudziwa naivo vanozvidaidza kuti vokuchecheudziwa, zvinova zvinhu zvidoitiwa nomanja pamuviri. <verse eid="EPH 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 2:12" />Yeukai kuti panguwa yakareyo manga mudopararanisiwa naKhirisitu, mudokamuhwa muchibiritsiwa kunzvahwa dzovaIzirairi, muri vatohwa kuzvibvumirano nokuno zvidovimbisiwa. Manga musinai tariro futi musinai Mwari panyika. <verse eid="EPH 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 2:13" />Asi zvino muna Khirisitu Jesu imipa manga muri kurefurefu mudonyedzewa papfupi nogazi raKhirisitu. <verse eid="EPH 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 2:14" />Nokuti ndiye rugare redu, adoita vairi kuti vave munhu mubodzi, futi adokoromora madziro yoruvengo yanga yachikonzera kutsvatsvana, <verse eid="EPH 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 2:15" />nokuparadza mutemo nomurairo, kuti asike maari munhu mubodzi mutsva panzvimbo yovairi, achiita rugare nozvakarezvo, <verse eid="EPH 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 2:16" />kuti mumuviri mubodzi atiyananise naMwari tese kuburikidza nomuchinjikwa, naiwo wopedza ruvengo. <verse eid="EPH 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 2:17" />Futi adouya koparidza rugare kwamuri imipa manga muri kurefurefu norugare, kunaivovo vanga vari papfupi. <verse eid="EPH 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 2:18" />Ndava kuburikidza naiye tese tinowana mapindiro kuna Baba noMweya mubodzi.<verse eid="EPH 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 2:19" />Saka ipopa hamuchava varendo novatohwa, asi zvino mava nzvahwa pabodzi novatsvene nonhengo dzoimba yaMwari, <verse eid="EPH 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 2:20" />mudovakhiwa pamusoro ponheyo dzonhumwa novaporofiti, Khirisitu Jesu pachake ari dombo ropakhona. <verse eid="EPH 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 2:21" />Maari chivakwa chese chidobatana pabodzi futi chinokura chichiva imba itsvene muna Ishe. <verse eid="EPH 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 2:22" />Maari naimimiwo mudovakhiwa kuti muve nzvimbo inogara Mwari muMweya.<verse eid="EPH 2:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="EPH 3" />
  <para style="s">Basa raPhauro kunoYamwe Marudzi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 3:1" />Nochikonzero chakarechi inini, Phauro, musungwa waKirisitu Jesu nopamusaka povoyamwe marudzi, <verse eid="EPH 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 3:2" />ndichigurupira kuti mudonzva kuva kwangu muchengeti wonyasha dzaMwari kwandidoitiwa zvichiitihwa imimi, <verse eid="EPH 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 3:3" />kuzivisiwa kwandidoita kuburikidza nokuzarurihwa zvidosvisviwa, sezvandidonyora muchikamu chidiki. <verse eid="EPH 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 3:4" />Mukaverenga zvakarezvi muchagona kunzvitsitsa maonero yangu zvidohwanda zvaKhirisitu, <verse eid="EPH 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 3:5" />zvanga zvisinai kuzivisiwa kuvanakomana vovanhu vonguwa yokare fanike kuzarurihwa kudoitiwa noMweya kunhumwa dzitsvene novaporofiti vache, <verse eid="EPH 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 3:6" />ndomaitikiro yazvidoita, kuti voyamwe marudzi vavewo vaji vonhaka, nonhengo dzomuviri mubodziyo, kuburikidza noNyaya Idonaka.<verse eid="EPH 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 3:7" />ndidoitiwa mushumiri woNyaya Idonaka yakarei zvichienderana nochipo chomutsa waMwari chandidopasiwa nokushanda kwomasimba yache. <verse eid="EPH 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 3:8" />Ndidopasiwa mutsa wakareyu, apa ndiri mudikidiki pavatsvene vese, kuti ndiparidze kuyamwe marudzi upfumi hwaKhirisitu husingapimike, <verse eid="EPH 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 3:9" />nokuisa pachenu kuvanhu vese urongwa hwozvidosvisvika zvidohwandisiwa kwomakore mazinji muna Mwari adosika zvinhu zvese; <verse eid="EPH 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 3:10" />kuti kuburikidza nokherekhe uchenjeri hudosiyana siyana hwaMwari huzikane kuvatongi nokumasimba yari kunzvimbo dzokudenga. <verse eid="EPH 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 3:11" />Zvakarezvi zvinoenderana nochinangwa chokusingapere chaadozazisa muna Khirisitu Jesu Ishe wedu, <verse eid="EPH 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 3:12" />maari ndimo matinokushinga nochivimbo chokupinda kuburikidza nokutenda kwedu maari. <verse eid="EPH 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 3:13" />Saka ndinokukumbirai kuti mureke kupera mwoyo nopamusaka pokutambudzika kwangu nokuda kwenyu, kunova kubhwinya kwenyu.<verse eid="EPH 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Rudo raKhirisitu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 3:14" />Nochikonzero ichochi ndinopfugama pamberi paBaba, <verse eid="EPH 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 3:15" />kubva kwaari mhuri dzese kudenga nopanyika dzinotenzewa mazita yadzene, <verse eid="EPH 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 3:16" />kuti akusimbisei mumunhu womukati muchiva nosimba kuburikidza noMweya wache zvichienderana nokupfuma kuri mukubhwinya kwache, <verse eid="EPH 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 3:17" />futi kuti Khirisitu agare mumwoyo menyu kuburikidza nokutenda, kuti imipa, muite midzi nokujirichira murudo, <verse eid="EPH 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 3:18" />kuti pabodzi novatsvene muve nosimba rokunzvitsitsa kuphanyuka, nokutambarara, nokukwirira, nokunoka kworudo raKhirisitu, <verse eid="EPH 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 3:19" />nokuziva rudo rinokunda ruzivo, futi kuti muzaziwe nokuzara kwese kwaMwari.<verse eid="EPH 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 3:20" />Zvino kuna iye anogona kuita nosimba rinoshanda matiri zvidokungudza zvidopindiridza kukunda zvese zvatinokumbira kana zvatinofunga, <verse eid="EPH 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 3:21" />kwaari mbakuve nokubhwinya mukherekhe nomuna Khirisitu Jesu munguwa dzese, nokusingaperepere. Ameni.<verse eid="EPH 3:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="EPH 4" />
  <para style="s">Kubatana Komuviri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 4:1" />Zvino inipano, ndiri mutorongo nokuda kwaIshe, ndinokukumbiritsai kuti murarame upenyu hunoenderana nokudaidziwa kwamudoitiwa, <verse eid="EPH 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 4:2" />muve nokuzvideredza kwese muchizvininipisa, munokutsungirira, nokuitirana mwoyo murefu murudo, <verse eid="EPH 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 4:3" />Vavarirai chaizvo kuchengeta kubatana kwoMweya muchisungo chorugare. <verse eid="EPH 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 4:4" />Kuno muviri mubodzi noMweya mubodzi, sezvamudodaidziwawo kutariro ibodzi yokudaidziwa kwenyu, <verse eid="EPH 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 4:5" />Ishe mubodzi, kutenda kubodzi, ruombeko ribodzi, <verse eid="EPH 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 4:6" />Mwari mubodzi naBaba vedu tese, ari pamusoro pozvese kuburikidza nozvese futi muno vese.<verse eid="EPH 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 4:7" />Asi mutsa udopiwa kuno umwe noumwe wedu zvichienderana nochiyero chokupa kwaKhirisitu. <verse eid="EPH 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 4:8" />Saka zvinotauhwa kuti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EPH 4:8">“Paadokwira kumusoro</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EPH 4:8">adotungamira vasungwa, futi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EPH 4:8">adopasa zvipo kuvanhu.”<verse eid="EPH 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 4:9" />Kunyaira kuti “Adokwira,” zvinorevei izvozvo asi kuti adoburuka pakare kunzvimbo dzidonoka dzonyika? <verse eid="EPH 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 4:10" />Iyeyo adoburuka ndiye adokwira pakare kumusorosoro kwodenga rese, kuti azaze zvinhu zvese. <verse eid="EPH 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 4:11" />Zvipo zvache nzvokuti, vamwe vave nhumwa, vamwe vaporofiti, vamwe vaparidzi, vamwe vafundisi vamwewo vadzidzisi, <verse eid="EPH 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 4:12" />kuitira kuti vatsvene vave vadokwana vanogona kuita basa rokushumira, vachivakha muviri waKirisitu, <verse eid="EPH 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 4:13" />kusvikira tese tava vabodzi pakutenda nopakuziva mwanakomana waMwari, tichiva vakuru pazera, nopachiyero chokuzara kwomumhu waKhirisitu. <verse eid="EPH 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 4:14" />Kuti tirege kuramba tiri vacheche, vokumbondogwididzihwa nokusundiwa nomhepo yese yese yodzidziso, nokufurira kwovanhu, nonzeru dzomambere yadoipa. <verse eid="EPH 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 4:15" />Asi kuti, titaure chokwadi murudo, tinofanira kukura maari pazvese, iye Khirisitu musoro, <verse eid="EPH 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 4:16" />kubva paari muviri wese, unobatanidziwa nokusunganidziwa pabodzi zvichiitiwa nonhengo imwe noimwe kuburikidza nozvainopasa, kana nhengo imwe noimwe ichishanda zvidonaka, zvokonzera kukura kwomuviri nokuzvivakha kwawene murudo.<verse eid="EPH 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Upenyu Hutsva muna Khirisitu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 4:17" />Zvino ndinosimbisa zvakarezvi nokupfakaza muna Ishe, kuti muchirekera kuita magariro yadofanana nowoyamwe marudzi, vanogara muudzemwa hwopfungwa dzavo, <verse eid="EPH 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 4:18" />vadoputihwa pakunzvitsitsa kwavo, vatohwa paupenyu hwaMwari nondava youdzemwa huri mavari, nondava yokuoma kwavo mwoyo, <verse eid="EPH 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 4:19" />vadova vanonyadzisa futi vadozvipira kuzvinhu zvomufumu, vachiita zvese zvoutsambwa nomarudzi yese yonhafu.<verse eid="EPH 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 4:20" />Hamunai kudzidza Khirisitu nonzira idodaro! <verse eid="EPH 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 4:21" />kana mudonzva pamusoro pache futi mudodzidza maari, chokwadi sezvachiri muna Jesu. <verse eid="EPH 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 4:22" />Sunhurai unhu hwokare hunova hwomararamiro yokare yadoora nondava yokuchiva kunofurira, <verse eid="EPH 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 4:23" />moitiwa vatsva mumweya nomupfungwa dzenyu, <verse eid="EPH 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 4:24" />mosimira unhu hutsva, hudosikiwa mumufananidzo waMwari mukururama kwochokwadi noutsvene.<verse eid="EPH 4:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EPH 4:25" />Naizvozvo, munhu wese mbaabiritse mabhwodo, munhu wese mbaataure chokwadi kumabiyake, ndava tese tiri nhengo dzomuviri mubodzi. <verse eid="EPH 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EPH 4:26" />Karipai asi regai kuita chitadzo, zuva mbarireke kudoka mudondomwamwa, <verse eid="EPH 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EPH 4:27" />futi rekai kupasa nzvimbo kuna jabhurosi. <verse eid="EPH 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EPH 4:28" />Mbavha mbaireke kudzoba pakare, asi mbaashandewo, aite basa nokutendeka nomaoko yache, kuti agonewo kupasa vanoda kuyamuhwa. <verse eid="EPH 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EPH 4:29" />Rekai kutendera kunyaira kudonyangara kuchibirika mumiromo yenyu, asi mbakuve kudonaka kunovakha, zvichienderana nomamiriro yozvinhu, kuti kupase mutsa kunovanonzva. <verse eid="EPH 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EPH 4:30" />Futi regai kugumbura Mweya Mutsvene waMwari, adoisiwa pamuri kuti ave chisimbiso kusvikira pazuva rokudzikinuhwa. <verse eid="EPH 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EPH 4:31" />Kuvirai kurefu naimimi kuchenama kwese, kukaripa nokumwamwa, kupopotana noguhwa, nokurongerana zvinhu zvidoipa kwese. <verse eid="EPH 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EPH 4:32" />Ivai notsitsi futi muchiyamurana, moregererana fanike kuregerehwa kwamudoitiwa naMwari muna Khirisitu.<verse eid="EPH 4:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="EPH 5" />
  <para style="s">Kurarama Muchiedza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 5:1" />Naizvozvo ivai vateveri vaMwari, fanike vana vanodiwa, <verse eid="EPH 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 5:2" />futi tekairai murudo, sekudiwa kwatidoitiwa naKhirisitu ndokuzvipira nondava yedu, kunge chipiriso chohwema hunonushira kuna Mwari.<verse eid="EPH 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 5:3" />Asi upombwe noutsambwa hwese kana nhafu mbazvirege kunzvika kuti zviri pakati penyu, mbapandova nozvidokodzera pakati povatsvene. <verse eid="EPH 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 5:4" />Mbapareke kuva noutsambwa, nokunyaira kudofumuka kana kwokupusa, zvinova zvisingakodzere, asi panzvimbo yozvakarezvo mbapave nokupereka kutenda. <verse eid="EPH 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 5:5" />Ivai nochokwadi chokuti, hapanai mhombwe kana munhu woutsambwa, kana anonhafu (munhu adodaroyo munamati wozvifananidzo), haangave nonhaka muumambo hwaKhirisitu nohwaMwari.<verse eid="EPH 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 5:6" />Mbakureke kuva noanokufurirai nomazvi yomangamanga, ndava ukari hwaMwari hunotouya nozvakarezvo, pamusoro povana vasingatetekere. <verse eid="EPH 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 5:7" />Saka rekai kuwadzana navo, <verse eid="EPH 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 5:8" />Ndava manga muri rima, asi zvino mava chiedza muna Ishe; tekairai kunge vana vochiedza <verse eid="EPH 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 5:9" />nokuti muchero wochiedza unowanika munozvese zvidonaka nozvidokohoroka nomuchokwadi. <verse eid="EPH 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 5:10" />Edzai kupfunda kuita zvinofadza kunaIshe. <verse eid="EPH 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 5:11" />Regai kubatanidzihwa nomabasa yorima yasinai zvibereko, asi pachinzvimbo chozvakarezvo, zviisei pachenu. <verse eid="EPH 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 5:12" />Ndava zvinonyadzisa kutaura zvinhu zvavanoita padohwanda, <verse eid="EPH 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 5:13" />asi kana chinhu chipi nochipi chaisiwa pachenu nochiedza chinooneka. <verse eid="EPH 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 5:14" />Nokuti chese chinooneka chava chiedza saka zvinonyaihwa kuti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EPH 5:14">“Muenzeri, muka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EPH 5:14">futi muka kuvadopfa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EPH 5:14">Khirisitu achakupasa chiedza.”<verse eid="EPH 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 5:15" />Chenjererai matekairiro yamunoita, aikona kuita kunge madzemwa asi itai kunge vadochenjera, <verse eid="EPH 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 5:16" />muchiita zvese zvinodikana panguwa, ndava mazuva yadoipa. <verse eid="EPH 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 5:17" />Saka regai kuva madzemwa, asi nzvitsitsai kuti kuda kwaIshe nghupi.<verse eid="EPH 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 5:18" />Futi rekai kukorewa nowaini, ndava ndipo panokutadza kuzvibata; asi zaziwai naMweya, <verse eid="EPH 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 5:19" />mutaurirane mumaphisarema nonziyo nozvimbo zvomweya, muchiimba muchiita mumwoyo wenyu wese zvinobuya kuna Ishe, <verse eid="EPH 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 5:20" />nguwa dzese pazvinhu zvese pasai kutenda kuna Mwari Baba muzita raIshe wedu Jesu Khirisitu.<verse eid="EPH 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vakadzi naAnhurume</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 5:21" />Zvidikipisei umwe kunoumwe nokuti munoremekedza Khirisitu.<verse eid="EPH 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 5:22" />Vakadzi, zvidikipisei kuna varume venyu, kunge kuna Ishe. <verse eid="EPH 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 5:23" />Ndava murume ndiye musoro womunhikadzi fanike Khirisitu anova musoro wokherekhe, unova muviri wache, futi iye ndiye Muponisi wayene. <verse eid="EPH 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 5:24" />Fanike kherekhe iri pasi paKhirisitu, saka vakadzi mbavavewo pasi povarume vavo pano zvese.<verse eid="EPH 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EPH 5:25" />Varume, idai vakadzi venyu, fanike Khirisitu adoda kherekhe ndokuzvipereka nondava yayene, <verse eid="EPH 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EPH 5:26" />kuti ainatse, aitsvindise nokuishambidza nomvura pashoko, <verse eid="EPH 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EPH 5:27" />kuti aipereke kwaari pachake iri kherekhe inobhwinya, isinai kadondorozi kana kuunyana kana chimwewo chinhu chidodaro, kuti ive itsvene isinai chinoshoreka. <verse eid="EPH 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EPH 5:28" />Zvidodaro vanhurume mbavadewo vakadzi vavo fanike miviri yavo chaiyo. Anoda mukadzi wache anozvidawo. <verse eid="EPH 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EPH 5:29" />Nokuti hapanai munhu anovenga muviri wache, asi anouposha nokuuchengeta, fanike zvinoitiwa kherekhe naKhirisitu, <verse eid="EPH 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EPH 5:30" />ndava tiri nhengo dzomuviri wake. <verse eid="EPH 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EPH 5:31" />“nochikonzero chakarechi munhurume achasiya baba vache namaache wobatanidziwa nomukadzi wache, vairi vakarevo vachava muiri mubodzi.” <verse eid="EPH 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EPH 5:32" />Chidohwanzika chakarechi chidodzama zvidonyanya, asi ndiri kureva zvaKhirisitu nokherekhe, <verse eid="EPH 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EPH 5:33" />zvidodaro, umwe noumwe mbaade mukadzi wache kunge kuzvida kwaanoita, futi munhikadzi mbaone kuti anoremekedza murume wache.<verse eid="EPH 5:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="EPH 6" />
  <para style="s">Vana noVabereki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 6:1" />Vana, tetekerai vabereki venyu muna Ishe, nokuti zvakarezvi ndizvo zvidokohoroka. <verse eid="EPH 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 6:2" />“Remekedza baba vako namaako” (wakareyu ndiwo murairo wokuthanga uno chivimbiso), <verse eid="EPH 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 6:3" />“kuti zvikuitire bhwino futi kuti urarame nguwa irefu panyika.”<verse eid="EPH 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 6:4" />Anababa, rekai kusora muchikaripisa vana venyu, asi varerei mukurovedzera nomukuraira kwaIshe.<verse eid="EPH 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Varanda nanaTenzi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 6:5" />Varanda, tetekerai anatenzi venyu vopanyika, muvache nokutetemera, nomwoyo udorurama, fanike kuna Khirisitu. <verse eid="EPH 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 6:6" />Aikona kundozviita pamunoonewa, fanike vafadzi vovanhu, asi fanike muri kushandira Khirisitu, muchiita kuda kwaMwari zvichibva pamwoyo. <verse eid="EPH 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 6:7" />Muchiita basa nochido fanike kuna Ishe aikona kuvanhu, <verse eid="EPH 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 6:8" />muchiziva kuti chese chidonaka chinoitiwa nomunhu, achatambira zvibodzibodzizvo kubva kuna Ishe, kana ari muranda kana adosununguka.<verse eid="EPH 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 6:9" />Anatenzi, itai zvibodzibodzizvo kuvaranda venyu, morega kuvachisa, muchiziva kuti Tenzi wavo nowenyu mese ari kudenga, futi kuti hapanai rusaruro kwaari.<verse eid="EPH 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Zvombo Zvese Zvokuhwa zvaMwari</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 6:10" />Pakupedzisira, ivai mudosimba muna Ishe pakare mova mumasimba yache makuru. <verse eid="EPH 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 6:11" />Simirai zvombo zvese zvaMwari, kuti mukone kumira muchihwisana nomazano yajabhurosi. <verse eid="EPH 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 6:12" />Ndava tiri kuhwisanaba nonyama nogazi, novatongi, novakuruvakuru, novanomasimba yonyika yorima razvino, nohondo dzomweya idoipa dziri munzvimbo dzomudenga. <verse eid="EPH 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 6:13" />Saka torai zvombo zvese zvaMwari, kuti mugone kudzivisa pazuva ridoipa, futi kuti kana mapedza zvese, mumire.<verse eid="EPH 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 6:14" />Saka mirai, mudosunga zviuno zvenyu nobhande rochokwadi, mudoisa pachipfuwa chivharidziro chokururama, <verse eid="EPH 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 6:15" />futi mudosimira shangu mutsoka dzenyu mugadziriro yovhangeri rorunyararo, <verse eid="EPH 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 6:16" />pamusoro pozvakarezvi zvese, torai chivharidziro chokutenda, chokudzimwisa miseve inopfuta yoadoipa. <verse eid="EPH 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 6:17" />Futi torai ngundu youtare yoruponiso, nobakatwa roMweya, ndiro shoko raMwari. <verse eid="EPH 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 6:18" />Namatai nguwa dzese muMweya, nominamato yese nokukumbira. Pakupedzisira garai mudopepuka nokushingirira kwese, muchinamatira vatsvene vese, <verse eid="EPH 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 6:19" />naininiwo mundinamatire, kuti pandinoshama muromo ndinyaire ndidoshinga pakuparidza zvidohwanda zvovhangeri, <verse eid="EPH 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 6:20" />ndava ndiri mumiririri warene ari mumangetani. Ndinamatirei kuti ndiriise pachenu ndidoshinga, sezvandinofanira kutaura.<verse eid="EPH 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kumoresa Kwokupedzisira</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 6:21" />Zvino kuti muzivewo kuti zvidoita tini kwandiri nozvandiri kuita, muchanyepewa zvese naTaichikasi hama inodiwa futi mushumiri adotendeka muna Ishe. <verse eid="EPH 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 6:22" />Ndamutumira kwamuri pamusaka pozvakarezvi, kuti muzive kuti zvidoita sei kwatiri, futi kuti akurudzire mwoyo yenyu.<verse eid="EPH 6:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 6:23" />Hama rugare, norudo, nokutenda zvinobva kuna Mwari Baba naIshe Jesu Khirisitu mbazvive nemi. <verse eid="EPH 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 6:24" />Mutsa mbauve novese vanoda Ishe wedu Jesu Khirisitu norudo rusingapere.<verse eid="EPH 6:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 6" />
</usx>